<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - WD-40 started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - WD-40 started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim started coverage of WD-40 Co with a rating of outperform significantly, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1-3/4 to 49-1/2.</p>
</text>
